1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:04,709
If the zombie apocalypse starts while you're in the checkout line, don't look back.

2
00:00:05,849 --> 00:00:07,260
Did you find everything okay?

3
00:00:08,449 --> 00:00:09,865
There's... a line behind me.

4
00:00:11,049 --> 00:00:14,205
Smile. Breathe out. Don't turn around.

5
00:00:14,755 --> 00:00:15,307
Next.

6
00:00:15,587 --> 00:00:18,949
Pay. Smile. Walk out slowly.
